1
00:00:00,109 --> 00:00:01,359
90% of traders

2
00:00:01,359 --> 00:00:02,289
lose money. 💸

3
00:00:02,289 --> 00:00:03,064
Here's the setup

4
00:00:03,064 --> 00:00:04,841
the other 10% use.

5
00:00:04,841 --> 00:00:06,042
Smart money can't buy

6
00:00:06,042 --> 00:00:07,712
millions without sellers.

7
00:00:07,712 --> 00:00:08,262
So where do they

8
00:00:08,262 --> 00:00:09,138
find them?

9
00:00:09,138 --> 00:00:10,013
Equal lows.

10
00:00:10,013 --> 00:00:11,163
Retail traders hide

11
00:00:11,163 --> 00:00:12,188
their stop losses

12
00:00:12,188 --> 00:00:13,348
right below them.

13
00:00:13,348 --> 00:00:15,217
That's sell-side liquidity.

14
00:00:15,340 --> 00:00:16,465
Step 1: the sweep. ⚡

15
00:00:16,465 --> 00:00:17,140
Price dives

16
00:00:17,140 --> 00:00:17,955
under the lows,

17
00:00:17,955 --> 00:00:19,080
triggers every stop,

18
00:00:19,080 --> 00:00:20,576
and snaps right back.

19
00:00:20,640 --> 00:00:21,865
Step 2: the shift. 📈

20
00:00:21,865 --> 00:00:23,290
Strong bullish candles break

21
00:00:23,290 --> 00:00:24,665
the last swing high.

22
00:00:24,665 --> 00:00:26,131
The trend just flipped.

23
00:00:26,198 --> 00:00:27,504
Step 3: the gap.

24
00:00:27,504 --> 00:00:28,654
Candle one's high

25
00:00:28,654 --> 00:00:30,054
and candle three's low

26
00:00:30,054 --> 00:00:31,114
don't overlap.

27
00:00:31,114 --> 00:00:32,288
That empty space is

28
00:00:32,288 --> 00:00:33,835
your Fair Value Gap. 🟨

29
00:00:33,835 --> 00:00:34,990
Now be patient. ⏳

30
00:00:34,990 --> 00:00:35,890
Let price come back

31
00:00:35,890 --> 00:00:36,645
into the gap.

32
00:00:36,645 --> 00:00:37,815
That's your entry.

33
00:00:37,815 --> 00:00:38,540
Stop loss

34
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:39,700
below the sweep.

35
00:00:39,700 --> 00:00:40,925
Target the equal highs

36
00:00:40,925 --> 00:00:41,500
above, where

37
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:43,190
the next liquidity sits.

38
00:00:44,007 --> 00:00:44,667
Target hit. ✅

39
00:00:44,667 --> 00:00:46,382
Clean, simple, repeatable.

40
00:00:46,382 --> 00:00:47,477
Sweep. Shift. Gap. 🔁

41
00:00:47,477 --> 00:00:48,452
Save this, and follow

42
00:00:48,452 --> 00:00:49,693
for part 2.
